# The sources are LF in this repository, and the scripts are read by Linux runners: a CRLF shebang
# there is "bad interpreter", and a contributor whose git has core.autocrlf=true silently rewrites
# whole files to CRLF on checkout or `git apply`. Pinning the endings here keeps that out of everyone's
# hands. Only the listed types are touched — nothing is renormalized wholesale.
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.zig text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
